{
  "adds": ["frule"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "title": { "zh": "同一条用两次", "en": "The same given twice" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "往前推不会拿走原来的已知：「对所有」那一句用过一次还在，可以再用，取另一样东西。",
        "en": "Going forward does not take the given away: the “for all” sentence is still there after one use, and can be used again, for another thing."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "r-frule",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标", "en": "Goal" } }],
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Even(s(s(s(s(zero)))))", "hyps": ["∀x. Even(x) → Even(s(s(x)))", "Even(zero)"] },
        { "goal": "Odd(s(s(s(s(s(zero))))))", "hyps": ["∀x. Odd(x) → Odd(s(s(x)))", "Odd(s(zero))"] }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。", "en": "Design a proof assistant that proves every goal." },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "「对所有」那一句，用一次够吗？", "en": "Is one use of the “for all” given enough?" }],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = allE[use=[spec]]()",
        "c1r0 = allE[use=[spec]]()",
        "c2r0 = mp[use=[mp]]()",
        "c3r0 = mp[use=[mp]]()",
        "c0 = frule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = frule(c0, c1r0)",
        "c2 = erule(c1, c2r0)",
        "c3 = erule(c2, c3r0)",
        "c4 = assumption(c3)",
        "out <- c4"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
